			"notes": "## BorderlessMC 1.0.0\n\nInitial public release.\n\n### Features\n- Borderless fullscreen toggle using `F11`\n- Multi-monitor aware (uses current monitor)\n- Restores previous window size and position on exit\n- Toggle mod enabled/disabled via keybind (default: `B`)\n- F3 debug overlay status line\n\n### Requirements\n- Minecraft 1.21.11\n- Fabric Loader\n- Fabric API\n- Java 21"
